    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Viscosity and porosity make sense, but I'm struggling to see how that explains the randomness. It's not a consistent skip or a whole batch failing; it's just these weird, sporadic gaps. It honestly feels like there's some kind of invisible interference or a \"glitch\" in the transfer itself. Like, if you had to describe this sensation of the pigment just being stolen or stripped away during the heat cycle, is there any way to model that as some kind of external disruption rather than just a chemical mismatch?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
